          "content": "\\begin{aligned} area of   \\Delta  OAB  &= \\frac{1}{2}  AB  \\times  OM  = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 21\\sqrt{3} \\times \\frac{21}{2}  cm ^2 \\\\&= \\frac{441}{4} \\sqrt{3}  cm ^2\\end{aligned}\\tag{3}"
